{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34394","headline":"四月十五日道室书事寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"四月十五日道室书事寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌饭新炊芼臛香，道家斋日以爲常。\n月苗杯举存三洞，云蘂函开叩九章。\n一掬阳泉堪作雨，数铢秋石欲成霜。\n可中值着雷平信，爲觅闲眠苦竹牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}